  link: "#process/interaction/publication"
  tooltip: "Construct and recheck candidate; Operational record persistence (MOD-011); Require no retained journal, reread the before-set under exclusion, compare its revision with the initial snapshot, construct the lossless complete candidate, and validate the expected revision, target identities, declared reads, references, and preservation rules. No declared identity is silently refreshed."
  style.fill: "#EEF6F1"
  style.stroke: "#597390"
