  link: "#process/interaction/publication"
  tooltip: "Publish exact candidate bytes; Operational record persistence (MOD-011); Recheck declared read identities, recognize every target as its recorded before or candidate value, and publish only declared candidate writes through guarded filesystem operations. Repeat ownership, known-state, and target checks during replacement; verify all candidate identities afterward."
