  link: "#process/interaction/publication"
  tooltip: "Persist committed phase; Operational record persistence (MOD-011); Recheck the declared read basis after replacement and before commitment, then durably rewrite the journal with phase=committed. Failures do not expose the prepared saved receipt as successful publication."
